.Language=English,English
.PluginContents=Editor RegExp plugin

@Contents
$^#Plugin purpose

 Plugin generates a string list for more comfortable navigation in the text.
 For example: function list in C/C++ source code.
 The criterion of definition of function is set by regular expression.
 Plugin will work with FAR 1.60 and later.

 The bugreports, wishes and regular expressions for definition of functions
 for various types of files are welcomed.

 #Before using of module, run FileTypes.reg!#

 Sorry for bad english. It is result of translation by Stylus98 :)

 Contacts: Alexey I. Kardashevsky, aik@@agava.com, alexhome@@aha.ru, 2:5020/607.5.


~Copyrights~@Copyrights@




